{"ancestors": "0,9016453,9017025", "bizKey": "9017032", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-31 15:10:50", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p>近年来我国低温鲜奶在整体白奶消费中占比明显提升。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/31/544c7461-f2b8-4eb8-898f-9fb4ba9751bd-1690787968329.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 379.98px;height: 263.73px;\"/></p><p>中国低温鲜奶占白奶消费比重在30%以内，低于美国、日本、韩国、英国等国家的90%+，低于俄罗斯的60%+。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/31/dd08e556-a6bd-42f9-81a4-baac0a851c64-1690788002182.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 379.98px;height: 288.92px;\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>通常低温鲜奶的定价为常温奶的1-3倍</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/31/f8af8c3b-1533-4dce-a11b-5c4c2985fd9a-1690788183727.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p>国内鲜奶行业同样格局分散，光明市占率第一，CR3近三年呈缓慢上升趋势。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/31/d034e519-1942-4a89-bf6a-94aa403102d6-1690788261840.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "XN", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "鲜奶", "parentId": 9017025, "pctChg": -0.45, "reason": "低温奶具有短保特点，对冷链要求高，区域乳企往往能做到牧场-工厂-销区相匹配，区域优势更强；通常低温鲜奶的定价为常温奶的1-3倍", "remark": "", "sort": 2, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9017032, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-08-04 10:50:26"}
